  "body": "A large flat section, a flexible two-part layout and a central Orewa location, this is a property with plenty to offer now and exciting potential for the future.\r\n\r\nSet on approximately 809sqm of flat freehold land, the home is just a short walk from Orewa Beach, shops, cafés and the town centre. Whether you’re looking for extra space for family or a property with future possibilities, this is a home that gives you plenty of options.\r\n\r\nThe home is arranged in two separate living areas, each with its own kitchen, living space, bathroom and laundry, giving families plenty of flexibility and privacy.\r\n\r\nMain Home\r\n\r\n• 2 bedrooms plus a study\r\n• Separate sunny living room opening to the covered deck\r\n• Open-plan kitchen and dining area\r\n• Bathroom plus separate laundry\r\n• Bright sunroom offering extra space to enjoy or simply relax\r\n\r\nSeparate Wing\r\n\r\n• 2 bedroom\r\n• Sunny living room\r\n• Bathroom plus separate laundry\r\n• A private and comfortable setup for extended family or guests\r\n\r\nOutside, there’s plenty of outdoor space, along with a separate garage, storage and carport. The generous 809sqm level site also offers exciting potential to explore future development options.\r\n\r\nWith its versatile layout, substantial section and central Orewa location, this is a property with plenty of possibilities for the future. Contact us today for more information or to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
